{'symbol': 'JCI', 'date': '2022-01-19 01:00:00', 'title': "JOHNSON CONTROLS RANKED AMONG WORLD'S TOP 100 MOST SUSTAINABLE CORPORATIONS", 'text': "CORK, IRELAND, JAN. 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0JOHNSON CONTROLS\xa0(NYSE: JCI),\xa0THE GLOBAL LEADER FOR SMART AND SUSTAINABLE BUILDINGS,\xa0TODAY\xa0ANNOUNCED IT HAS BEEN NAMED AMONG THE WORLD'S 100 MOST SUSTAINABLE CORPORATIONS IN THE 2022 GLOBAL 100 RANKING BY CORPORATE KNIGHTS. IT IS THE EIGHTH TIME\xa0JOHNSON CONTROLS HAS RECEIVED THIS HONOR."}{'symbol': 'JCI', 'date': '2022-01-18 09:30:00', 'title': 'SENSORMATIC SOLUTIONS BY JOHNSON CONTROLS PRIORITIZES RESPONSIBLE RETAIL BY CONTINUED FOCUS AND INVESTMENT INTO SUSTAINABILITY PRACTICES', 'text': 'NEUHAUSEN, SWITZERLAND--(BUSINESS WIRE)--SENSORMATIC SOLUTIONS, THE LEADING GLOBAL RETAIL SOLUTIONS PORTFOLIO OF JOHNSON CONTROLS, TODAY RELEASED ITS 2021 SUSTAINABILITY STORY WHITE PAPER, DETAILING ITS SUSTAINABILITY EFFORTS. SENSORMATIC SOLUTIONS IS BUILT ON INNOVATION, AND IS DEDICATED TOWARD SUSTAINABLE PRODUCTS, SOLUTIONS, AND SERVICES. THE COMPANY ALSO EXTENDS ITS SUSTAINABILITY FOCUS TO INCLUDE ITS PEOPLE AND PROCESSES. “WE ARE COMMITTED TO DEVELOPING INNOVATIONS THAT POSITIVELY IMPACT S'}{'symbol': 'JCI', 'date': '2022-01-18 06:55:00', 'title': 'JOHNSON CONTROLS UNVEILS INDUSTRY-FIRST OPENBLUE INDOOR AIR QUALITY AS A SERVICE SOLUTION TO HELP ORGANIZATIONS KEEP OCCUPANTS SAFE AND HEALTHY', 'text': 'CORK, IRELAND, JAN. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 JOHNSON CONTROLS \xa0(NYSE: JCI), THE GLOBAL LEADER FOR SMART, HEALTHY AND SUSTAINABLE BUILDINGS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF\xa0OPENBLUE\xa0INDOOR AIR QUALITY AS A SERVICE. THE NEW OFFERING IS THE FIRST DEDICATED "AS-A-SERVICE" INDOOR AIR QUALITY\xa0(IAQ)\xa0SOLUTION FOR BUILDINGS, DELIVERING ENERGY-EFFICIENT, TURNKEY CLEAN AIR OUTCOMES WITH AN INNOVATIVE FINANCING MODEL.'}